    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. Now satisfying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;satisfying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;gives,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
